/// Balances at the start of the ledger. An opening is a statement, not a flow: it carries the cost
/// and the day of each lot, so a lot may be older than any tax table, and no law sees it.
opening 2024-09-01
  checking    14_620.55 USD
  savings    148_000.00 USD
  retirement  86_400.00 USD
  espp-cash    4_200.00 USD
  fidelity      30.0000 VTI  basis 5_100.00 USD since 2020-05-11
  fidelity      12.0000 MSFT basis 3_000.00 USD since 2021-06-15
  fidelity     300.0000 BND  basis 25_500.00 USD since 2021-08-11

