/// Monthly pay from Northwind. 14% into the 401(k), 10% into the employee stock purchase plan, which holds it `for espp`: tied, not available to spend, until it buys shares.
2024-09-30 me <- northwind 14_000.00 USD
  -> retirement     1_958.33 USD           // 401(k) deferral
  -> espp-cash      1_400.00 USD for espp  // ESPP contribution, after tax
  -> irs            2_650.00 USD
  -> payroll-office 1_071.00 USD           // Social Security and Medicare
  -> checking       ...
